Bind Npc 13009 Zone 21
Quest 64 "Monster Suppression Squad (I)"
    Journal "Obtain orders for the Bandit Suppression Squad from [Mercenary Captain] Cougar."
    Collect 1 of 910117000

Requires player level >= 5

Rewards
    Give 5 of 910115000
    Give 5 of 910116000
    Give 1250 experience
    Give 2000 coins

On offer
    Say "Infiltrate the bandit base, eliminate their leader, and bring back the proof. Simple enough, no?"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "After wiping out the bandits and their boss Labuma, take his proof to Mercenary Captain Cougar for a reward."

